# Build context hygiene. Without this, `docker build` ships the local venv,
# node_modules and .git into the daemon on every build - which is both slow and
# a correctness problem: a Windows/macOS venv copied into a Linux image contains
# binaries that cannot run there, and a stale node_modules shadows the clean
# `npm ci` the Dockerfile is trying to do.
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
.demo-logs
.demo-pids
ml-worker/logs
**/*.log
BENCHMARK.md
